WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:02.340
- So, former President
Trump's impeachment lawyers

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:03.840
have left en masse.

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:06.430
A lot of people are saying
that they are leaving like rats

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:07.930
leaving a sinking ship.

00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:10.140
In total, five respectable lawyers

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:12.330
have left the impeachment defense team.

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:14.320
This is really bad news
for former President Trump,

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:16.170
because the briefs in
the impeachment trial

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:17.270
are due very soon,

00:00:17.270 --> 00:00:19.160
and the team was headed
by a respectable lawyer

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:20.100
named Butch Bowers,

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:21.240
who has experience

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:23.140
representing very
high-profile politicians.

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:24.350
In particular, he represented

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:26.330
former South Carolina
Governor Mark Sanford

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:27.240
when he went on his whole

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:29.790
Appalachian Trail-Argentina affair thing.

00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:31.670
And Bowers didn't seem
to be a crazy person.

00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:34.560
He seemed to represent Mark
Sanford reasonably well.

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:36.860
So, let's talk about why
all of these lawyers left

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:37.693
in part two.

00:00:37.693 --> 00:00:39.983
So, subscribe, or I'll see you in court.

